              id="7bbbfd4c-03e9-46e5-8e8e-eb1a369cbd8c" name="Record operational actions"
              summary="Preserve acknowledgements, assessments and operational responses"
              description="&lt;p>An operational action is&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-end=&quot;314&quot; data-start=&quot;240&quot;>something a human (or the mission operations team) decides or performs&lt;/strong>.&lt;/p>&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p data-end=&quot;326&quot; data-start=&quot;317&quot;>Examples:&lt;/p>&#xA;&#xA;&lt;ul data-end=&quot;528&quot; data-start=&quot;328&quot;>&#xA;&#x9;&lt;li data-end=&quot;351&quot; data-section-id=&quot;1ydvpmf&quot; data-start=&quot;328&quot;>Acknowledge an alert.&lt;/li>&#xA;&#x9;&lt;li data-end=&quot;402&quot; data-section-id=&quot;l9idqs&quot; data-start=&quot;352&quot;>Execute the &amp;quot;Reaction Wheel Recovery&amp;quot; procedure.&lt;/li>&#xA;&#x9;&lt;li data-end=&quot;433&quot; data-section-id=&quot;1ipboip&quot; data-start=&quot;403&quot;>Request engineering support.&lt;/li>&#xA;&#x9;&lt;li data-end=&quot;456&quot; data-section-id=&quot;6bd6zs&quot; data-start=&quot;434&quot;>Classify an anomaly.&lt;/li>&#xA;&#x9;&lt;li data-end=&quot;480&quot; data-section-id=&quot;ewyc1k&quot; data-start=&quot;457&quot;>Add an operator note.&lt;/li>&#xA;&#x9;&lt;li data-end=&quot;510&quot; data-section-id=&quot;qjpk5s&quot; data-start=&quot;481&quot;>Approve a command sequence.&lt;/li>&#xA;&#x9;&lt;li data-end=&quot;528&quot; data-section-id=&quot;mfmxsh&quot; data-start=&quot;511&quot;>Close an alert.&lt;/li>&#xA;&lt;/ul>&#xA;">
